		{
			"name": "Architecture Documents",
			"description": "Repository-scoped architecture document generation, polling, retrieval, history, and regeneration.\n\n## Flow\n1. **Trigger Document** — starts async generation (returns 202 immediately)\n2. **Poll Job Status** — check progress (PENDING → RETRIEVING → GENERATING → VERIFYING → COMPLETED/FAILED)\n3. **Fetch Latest Completed** — get the latest completed document with ordered sections\n4. **List Version History** — see all versions for a repository (newest first)\n5. **Fetch Specific Version** — get a particular version's content\n6. **Regenerate** — create a new version after completion\n\nAll endpoints require a `repositoryId` that is owned by the authenticated user and in `READY` state with a `lastIndexedCommit`.",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Trigger Document Generation",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							},
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}",
								"type": "text"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"commitSha\": \"\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/repositories/{{repositoryId}}/architecture-doc",
							"host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
							"path": ["api", "repositories", "{{repositoryId}}", "architecture-doc"]
						},
						"description": "Start architecture document generation for a repository.\n\n**Body (optional):**\n- `commitSha` (optional): Must match the repository's `lastIndexedCommit` or be omitted.\n\n**Response (202):**\n```json\n{\n  \"docId\": \"uuid\",\n  \"jobId\": \"uuid\",\n  \"version\": 1,\n  \"status\": \"PENDING\"\n}\n```\n\nIf an active document is already being generated, returns the same document instead of creating a new one.\n\n⚠️ Requires a `READY` repository with `lastIndexedCommit` populated."
					},
					"response": [],
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"type": "text/javascript",
								"exec": [
									"pm.test('Document triggered (202)', function () {",
									"    pm.response.to.have.status(202);",
									"    const json = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.expect(json.success).to.be.true;",
									"    pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property('docId');",
									"    pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property('jobId');",
									"    pm.expect(json.data.docId).to.equal(json.data.jobId);",
									"    pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property('version');",
									"    pm.expect(json.data.status).to.be.oneOf(['PENDING','RETRIEVING','GENERATING','VERIFYING']);",
									"",
									"    // Auto-save docId for other requests",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('architectureDocId', json.data.docId);",
									"    console.log('✅ docId saved: ' + json.data.docId);",
									"});"
								]
							}
						}
					]
